# MOD VIEW (Setup, on by default): the LFOs and envelopes of the selected track's newest voice on the screen while
# it sounds (silent: its free-running LFO and the shared LFO, which move the sound anyway): the Filter page's curve at the cutoff as it sounds (the faint line stays at the knob), a tick on the knob
# an LFO moves, a dot along the Envelope page's curve. Off in Setup, or while the load is high (over 80 % until under
# 70 %): the plain pictures
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine knit
knob 3 cut 64
knob 3 fenv 64
knob 3 ltype wave
knob 3 ldest filter
knob 3 lx cutoff
knob 3 lx2 square
knob 3 lamt 127
knob 3 lspeed 1
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect page Filter
expect modview 1
wait 100
# silent: the knob's cutoff, no tick
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
# a note: the square LFO's first half opens the filter (bar 1 at 120 BPM: a second each half), then closes it
play 3 C4 on
wait 300
expect modcut >200
expect modticks 1
shot mod_filter_open.png
wait 1000
expect modcut <40
expect modticks 1
shot mod_filter_shut.png
play 3 C4 off
wait 1500
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
# the guard: a load over 80 % and MOD VIEW stops (the curve at the knob while the note sounds), back under 70 %
play 3 C4 on
wait 300
expect modcut >200
load 90
wait 300
expect modview 0
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
load 75
wait 300
expect modview 0
load 60
wait 300
expect modview 1
expect modcut <40
play 3 C4 off
load -1
wait 1500
# silent, the LFO free-running (filter free): it moves the sound with or without a note, so the curve and the tick
# follow it (its phase runs from the start: the square open now, shut a second later)
expect modcut 120
knob 3 ldest 6
wait 300
expect modcut >200
expect modticks 1
wait 1000
expect modcut <40
expect modticks 1
# back to the regular LFO (it waits for a note): the knob's cutoff, no tick
knob 3 ldest filter
wait 300
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
wait 1000
expect modcut 120
# the shared LFO (GLO's LFO page: T9's LFO slots) on T3's cutoff, a square a bar, silent: it moves too
knob 9 ltype 5
knob 9 lspeed 4
knob 9 lamt 127
knob 9 ldest 0
knob 9 lx 4
wait 300
expect modcut >200
expect modticks 1
wait 1000
expect modcut <40
expect modticks 1
knob 9 ltype 0
wait 300
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
# the Envelope page: the dot through a note (attack, decay, sustain held, release), none when it ends
knob 3 ltype off
knob 3 a 90
knob 3 d 90
knob 3 s 64
knob 3 r 90
turn SELECT -1
expect page Envelope
wait 100
expect envdot -1
play 3 C4 on
wait 60
expect envdot >16
expect envdot <60
shot mod_env_attack.png
wait 400
expect envdot >30
shot mod_env_decay.png
wait 3000
expect envdot >109
expect envdot <177
shot mod_env_sustain.png
wait 7000
expect envdot 177
play 3 C4 off
wait 200
expect envdot >140
shot mod_env_release.png
wait 6000
expect envdot -1
# Setup's MOD VIEW row (the FM-1's setting, as the theme): off, and the Filter page's curve stays at the knob
tap GLO
turn SELECT 6
expect page Setup
tap SEL
listen
row MOD VIEW
wait 50
turn ALGO -1
wait 100
expect modview 0
shot mod_setup_off.png
tap HOME
wait 100
tap EDIT
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect trk 3
expect page Filter
knob 3 ltype wave
play 3 C4 on
wait 300
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
play 3 C4 off
wait 1500
# nor the free-running LFO while silent
knob 3 ldest 6
wait 300
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
wait 1000
expect modcut 120
expect modticks 0
knob 3 ldest filter
# kept over a restart (saved with the project), and on again
wait 5000
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 400
expect modview 0
tap GLO
turn SELECT 6
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row MOD VIEW
wait 50
turn ALGO 1
wait 100
expect modview 1
